<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Biron.</hi></speaker> <p>Was, &#x017F;ind nur drey da?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Co&#x017F;t.</hi></speaker> <p>Nein Herr, es &#x017F;ind eben fu&#x0364;nfe,<lb/>
