<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Bir.</hi></speaker> <p>Wieviel macht es denn?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Co&#x017F;t.</hi></speaker> <p>Die Parten &#x017F;elb&#x017F;t, Herr! werden<lb/>
